msgstr "Lanjutkan"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:232
msgid "Erase & Install"
msgstr "Hapus & instal"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:277
msgid "Once, when it first starts"
msgstr "Sekali saja, saat pertama kali menyala"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:278
msgid "A blue screen asks to trust Monet. Use the arrow keys and Enter:"
msgstr ""
"Layar biru meminta Anda memercayai Monet. Gunakan tombol panah dan Enter:"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:289 setup/qml/Main.qml:290 setup/qml/Main.qml:291
#: setup/qml/Main.qml:294
msgctxt ""
"Enroll MOK, Continue, Yes, Reboot, Continue boot and monetsetup stay in English: the blue screen shows them that way"
msgid "Choose %1"
msgstr "Pilih %1"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:292
msgctxt ""
"Enroll MOK, Continue, Yes, Reboot, Continue boot and monetsetup stay in English: the blue screen shows them that way"
msgid "Type %1, then Enter"
msgstr "Ketik %1, lalu Enter"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:334
msgctxt ""
"Enroll MOK, Continue, Yes, Reboot, Continue boot and monetsetup stay in English: the blue screen shows them that way"
msgid ""
"It opens on Continue boot: don't choose that. If it happens anyway, the PC restarts and the blue screen comes back."
msgstr ""
"Layar ini terbuka di Continue boot: jangan pilih itu. Jika tetap terjadi, PC dimulai ulang dan layar biru muncul lagi."

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:337
msgid ""
"Take a photo of these steps with your phone first: this screen goes away when the PC restarts."
msgstr ""
"Foto langkah-langkah ini dengan ponsel Anda dulu: layar ini hilang saat PC dimulai ulang."

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:351
msgid "Hello"
msgstr "Halo"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:352
msgid ""
"Let's set up Monet. It takes about 15 minutes, and Windows sets itself up afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Mari siapkan Monet. Butuh sekitar 15 menit, dan Windows akan menyiapkan dirinya sendiri setelahnya."

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:354
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Bahasa"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:398
msgid "It's %1 there now"
msgstr "Di sana sekarang pukul %1"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:408
msgid ""
"Monet is already installed on this PC, but it can't start yet: the blue screen at its first start was skipped. Monet can ask again. Restart, and on the blue screen choose Enroll MOK, then Continue and Yes, type monetsetup, and choose Reboot."
msgstr ""
"Monet sudah terpasang di PC ini, tetapi belum bisa dimulai: layar biru saat pertama kali dimulai terlewati. Monet bisa meminta lagi. Mulai ulang, lalu di layar biru pilih Enroll MOK, kemudian Continue dan Yes, ketik monetsetup, lalu pilih Reboot."

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:412
msgid "Ask again and restart"
msgstr "Minta lagi dan mulai ulang"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:450
msgid "You're online"
msgstr "Anda sudah online"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:450 linux/libexec/monet-quick:5402
msgid "Connect to Wi-Fi"
msgstr "Hubungkan ke Wi-Fi"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:451
msgid ""
"Monet downloads itself and Windows while it installs. Windows will use this network too."
msgstr ""
"Monet mengunduh dirinya sendiri dan Windows selama penginstalan. Windows juga akan memakai jaringan ini."

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:460
msgid "Connected with a cable"
msgstr "Terhubung dengan kabel"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:491
msgctxt "a Wi-Fi network anyone can join, without a password"
msgid "Open"
msgstr "Terbuka"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:500
msgid "No networks found"
msgstr "Jaringan tidak ditemukan"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:517
msgid "Look again"
msgstr "Cari lagi"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:538
msgid "Who's using this PC?"
msgstr "Siapa yang memakai PC ini?"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:539
msgid "This is your account in Monet and in Windows."
msgstr "Ini akun Anda di Monet dan di Windows."

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:546
msgid "You sign in as %1"
msgstr "Anda masuk sebagai %1"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:555
msgid "Password again"
msgstr "Kata sandi lagi"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:559 setup/monet_setup/app.py:369
msgid "The passwords don't match."
msgstr "Kata sandinya tidak cocok."

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:560
msgid ""
"No password: Monet signs you in by itself, and anyone who uses this PC can open your account and change its settings."
msgstr ""
"Tanpa kata sandi: Monet memasukkan Anda dengan sendirinya, dan siapa pun yang memakai PC ini bisa membuka akun Anda dan mengubah pengaturannya."

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:605
msgid "Your apps"
msgstr "Aplikasi Anda"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:606
msgid ""
"Photos, Documents, Video, Music and Calculator are built in. What you add arrives after you sign in."
msgstr ""
"Foto, Dokumen, Video, Musik, dan Kalkulator sudah terpasang. Yang Anda tambahkan akan tersedia setelah Anda masuk."

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:617
msgctxt "the apps people use every day"
msgid "Everyday"
msgstr "Sehari-hari"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:617
msgctxt "more apps to choose from"
msgid "More"
msgstr "Lainnya"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:716
msgid "Ready to install"
msgstr "Siap diinstal"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:733
msgid "Erases this PC. Windows installs itself, only for games."
msgstr "Menghapus isi PC ini. Windows terinstal sendiri, hanya untuk game."

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:748
msgid "Monet next to my Windows"
msgstr "Monet berdampingan dengan Windows saya"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:752
msgid "Keeps Windows and your files. Monet makes room for itself."
msgstr "Mempertahankan Windows dan file Anda. Monet membuat ruang sendiri."

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:766 setup/qml/Main.qml:778 setup/monet_setup/disks.py:90
msgid "Disk"
msgstr "Disk"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:770
msgid "Looking for disks…"
msgstr "Mencari disk…"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:793
msgid "Bring my files"
msgstr "Bawa file saya"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:802
msgid "Encrypt this PC"
msgstr "Enkripsi PC ini"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:803
msgid ""
"Only this PC can read its disk: taken out, it's locked. Monet unlocks it by itself when it starts."
msgstr ""
"Hanya PC ini yang bisa membaca disknya: jika dilepas, disk terkunci. Monet membukanya sendiri saat menyala."

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:816
msgid ""
"Everything on this disk is erased, Windows and your files too. To keep them, choose Monet next to my Windows."
msgstr ""
"Semua di disk ini dihapus, termasuk Windows dan file Anda. Untuk menyimpannya, pilih Monet berdampingan dengan Windows saya."

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:831 setup/monet_setup/app.py:31
msgid "Installing Monet"
msgstr "Menginstal Monet"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:847
msgid ""
"The download is complete. Monet is unpacking and writing the system to your disk. Keep the PC on and the USB stick connected until All set appears."
msgstr ""

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:848
msgid ""
"You can leave it running. If the connection drops, Monet picks up where it stopped."
msgstr ""
"Anda bisa membiarkannya berjalan. Jika koneksi terputus, Monet akan melanjutkan dari titik terakhir."

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:854 setup/qml/Main.qml:929
msgid "Hide details"
msgstr "Sembunyikan detail"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:868
msgid "All set"
msgstr "Semua siap"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:871
msgid ""
"Take out the USB stick and restart. After you sign in, Monet gets Windows ready for your games by itself."
msgstr ""
"Cabut flashdisk lalu mulai ulang. Setelah Anda masuk, Monet akan menyiapkan Windows untuk game Anda dengan sendirinya."

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:872
msgid ""
"Take out the USB stick and restart. Your PC starts in Monet, and Windows is one click away."
msgstr ""
"Cabut flashdisk lalu mulai ulang. PC Anda akan dimulai di Monet, dan Windows tinggal sekali klik."

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:885
msgid "Your recovery key"
msgstr "Kunci pemulihan Anda"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:887
msgid ""
"This PC's disk is encrypted, and Monet unlocks it by itself. If it ever can't, after a big firmware update or with the disk in another PC, it asks for this key. Without it nobody can read the disk, not even you."
msgstr ""
"Disk PC ini dienkripsi, dan Monet membukanya sendiri. Jika suatu saat tidak bisa, setelah pembaruan firmware besar atau dengan disk di PC lain, Monet meminta kunci ini. Tanpanya tidak ada yang bisa membaca disk, bahkan Anda."

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:907
msgid ""
"Take a photo of it or write it down, and keep it somewhere other than this PC. It isn't shown again."
msgstr ""
"Foto atau tulis kunci ini, dan simpan di tempat lain selain PC ini. Kunci ini tidak akan ditampilkan lagi."

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:913
msgid "I've kept my recovery key"
msgstr "Saya sudah menyimpan kunci pemulihan"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:924
msgid "That didn't work"
msgstr "Tidak berhasil"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:1284
msgid "Hide"
msgstr "Sembunyikan"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:29
msgid "Preparing the disk"
msgstr "Menyiapkan disk"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:30
msgid "Downloading Monet"
msgstr "Mengunduh Monet"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:32
msgid "Setting up your account"
msgstr "Menyiapkan akun Anda"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:33
msgid "Bringing your files"
msgstr "Membawa file Anda"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:34
msgid "Finishing"
msgstr "Menyelesaikan"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:42
msgid "The web"
msgstr "Menjelajah web"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:43
msgid "Office"
msgstr "Office"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:43
msgid "Documents, sheets, slides"
msgstr "Dokumen, spreadsheet, presentasi"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:44
msgid "Mail"
msgstr "Email"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:44
msgid "Email and calendars"
msgstr "Email dan kalender"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:45
msgid "Talk while you play"
msgstr "Mengobrol sambil bermain"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:46
msgid "Music to stream"
msgstr "Streaming musik"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:47
msgid "Send files to your phone"
msgstr "Kirim file ke ponsel Anda"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:50
msgid "Record and stream games"
msgstr "Rekam dan streaming game"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:51
msgid "Paint and draw"
msgstr "Melukis dan menggambar"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:58 linux/libexec/monet-quick:5433
msgid "Documents"
msgstr "Dokumen"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:61
msgid "Calculator"
msgstr "Kalkulator"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:69
msgid "about %1 minute left"
msgid_plural "about %1 minutes left"
msgstr[0] "sekitar %1 menit lagi"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:389
msgid "Built in"
msgstr "Bawaan"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:442
msgid ""
"Monet makes room by shrinking Windows' drive from %1 to %2. Nothing in Windows is lost, and it checks its drive once the next time it starts."
msgstr ""
"Monet membuat ruang dengan mengecilkan drive Windows dari %1 menjadi %2. Tidak ada yang hilang di Windows, dan Windows memeriksa drive-nya sekali saat dinyalakan berikutnya."

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:453
msgid ""
"Your files in Windows (%1) don't fit next to Monet. Open them from Files once Monet is installed."
msgstr ""
"File Anda di Windows (%1) tidak muat di samping Monet. Buka dari File setelah Monet terinstal."

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:454
msgid ""
"Desktop, Documents, Pictures, Music, Videos and Downloads from Windows (%1). They stay in Windows too."
msgstr ""
"Desktop, Dokumen, Gambar, Musik, Video, dan Unduhan dari Windows (%1). Semuanya tetap ada di Windows juga."

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:498
msgid "This PC has %1 GB of memory. Monet needs at least 4 GB."
msgstr "PC ini memiliki memori %1 GB. Monet butuh setidaknya 4 GB."

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:507
msgid ""
"This PC's NVIDIA graphics card is older than the RTX 20 series. Monet draws with its open driver, fine for everyday things; games run best in Windows."
msgstr ""
"Kartu grafis NVIDIA di PC ini lebih lama dari seri RTX 20. Monet menggambar dengan driver terbukanya, cukup untuk keperluan sehari-hari; game berjalan paling baik di Windows."

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:509
msgid ""
"This PC's NVIDIA graphics chip is older than the RTX 20 series, so Monet uses the built-in graphics. Games run best in Windows."
msgstr ""
"Chip grafis NVIDIA di PC ini lebih lama dari seri RTX 20, jadi Monet memakai grafis bawaan. Game berjalan paling baik di Windows."

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:512
msgid ""
"This PC has %1 GB of memory. Monet runs, but slows down with many apps open: 8 GB is better."
msgstr ""
"PC ini memiliki memori %1 GB. Monet berjalan, tetapi melambat jika banyak aplikasi terbuka: 8 GB lebih baik."

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:521
msgid "No disk found to install Monet on."
msgstr "Tidak ada disk untuk menginstal Monet."

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:526
msgid "This disk is too small for Monet (it needs 70 GB)."
msgstr "Disk ini terlalu kecil untuk Monet (perlu 70 GB)."

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:602
msgid "%1 of %2 GB"
msgstr "%1 dari %2 GB"

#: setup/monet_setup/app.py:624
msgid "The installer stopped unexpectedly."
msgstr "Penginstal berhenti tiba-tiba."

#: setup/monet_setup/disks.py:158
msgid ""
"Windows is asleep, not shut down, so Monet can't make room on its drive. In Windows, hold Shift while you choose Shut down, then start Monet Setup again."
msgstr ""
"Windows sedang tidur, tidak dimatikan, jadi Monet tidak bisa membuat ruang di drive-nya. Di Windows, tahan Shift sambil memilih Matikan, lalu mulai Penyiapan Monet lagi."

#: setup/monet_setup/disks.py:160
msgid ""
"Windows' drive needs a check first. Start Windows, restart it once, then shut it down and start Monet Setup again."
msgstr ""
"Drive Windows perlu diperiksa dulu. Nyalakan Windows, mulai ulang sekali, lalu matikan dan mulai Penyiapan Monet lagi."

#: setup/monet_setup/disks.py:173
msgid "This disk has no EFI partition, so Windows doesn't start from it."
msgstr ""
"Disk ini tidak memiliki partisi EFI, jadi Windows tidak dimulai dari disk ini."

#: setup/monet_setup/disks.py:178
msgid ""
"Needs %1 of free space; this disk has %2. Shrink Windows' drive in Disk Management first."
msgstr ""
"Perlu ruang kosong %1; disk ini memiliki %2. Kecilkan drive Windows di Manajemen Disk terlebih dahulu."

#: setup/monet_setup/disks.py:184
msgid ""
"Windows' drive is encrypted with BitLocker, so Monet can't make room on it. Turn BitLocker off in Windows first, or choose Monet and Windows."
msgstr ""
"Drive Windows dienkripsi dengan BitLocker, jadi Monet tidak bisa membuat ruang di sana. Matikan BitLocker di Windows dulu, atau pilih Monet dan Windows."

#: setup/monet_setup/disks.py:194
msgid ""
"Windows' drive is too full to make room for Monet. Free up %1 in Windows, then try again."
msgstr ""
"Drive Windows terlalu penuh untuk membuat ruang bagi Monet. Kosongkan %1 di Windows, lalu coba lagi."

#: setup/monet_setup/install.py:225
msgid "The free space on the disk changed. Go back and choose again."
msgstr "Ruang kosong di disk berubah. Kembali dan pilih lagi."

#: setup/monet_setup/install.py:234
msgid "The new partitions didn't show up."
msgstr "Partisi baru tidak muncul."

#: setup/monet_setup/install.py:238
msgid "Windows' EFI partition wasn't found."
msgstr "Partisi EFI Windows tidak ditemukan."

#: setup/monet_setup/install.py:360
msgid ""
"The connection dropped and didn't come back. Check the Wi-Fi, then try again."
msgstr ""
"Koneksi terputus dan tidak tersambung kembali. Periksa Wi-Fi, lalu coba lagi."

#: setup/monet_setup/install.py:405
msgid "The encrypted disk wasn't found."
msgstr "Disk terenkripsi tidak ditemukan."

#: setup/monet_setup/install.py:437
msgid "Monet's system wasn't found after installing."
msgstr "Sistem Monet tidak ditemukan setelah penginstalan."

#: setup/monet_setup/install.py:755
msgid "Something unexpected went wrong. The details say what."
msgstr "Terjadi masalah tak terduga. Detailnya menjelaskan apa yang terjadi."

#: setup/monet_setup/network.py:77
msgid "The network didn't answer. Try again, or pick another network."
