msgid ""
"Windows didn't start: this PC couldn't open its boot entry. Next time, Monet uses another one."
msgstr ""
"Windows gagal dimulai: PC ini tidak dapat membuka entri boot-nya. Lain kali, Monet akan memakai entri lain."

#: crates/monet/src/trip.rs:326
msgid ""
"Windows didn't finish starting. Choose Play again to continue. If it happens again, open Settings, then Play on Windows, and choose Check."
msgstr ""
"Windows tidak selesai dimulai. Pilih Mainkan lagi untuk melanjutkan. Jika terjadi lagi, buka Pengaturan, lalu Main di Windows, dan pilih Periksa."

